<source>Ann Rheum Dis</source><year>2004</year><volume>63</volume><issue>11</issue><fpage>1483</fpage><lpage>1489</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/ard.2003.013938</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Yong PF, Milner PC, Payne JN, Lewis PA, Jennison C. Inequalities in access to knee joint replacements for people in need. Ann Rheum Dis. 2004; 63(11):1483&#x02013;9. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15479899</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR9"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dunlop</surname><given-names>DD</given-names></name><name><surname>Song</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Manheim</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Racial disparities in joint replacement use among older adults</article-title><source>Med Care</source><year>2003</year><volume>41</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>288</fpage><lpage>298</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00005650-200302000-00010</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Dunlop DD, Song J, Manheim LM, Chang RW. Racial disparities in joint replacement use among older adults. Med Care. 2003;41(2):288&#x02013;98. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12555056</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dixon</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Shaw</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ebrahim</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Dieppe</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Trends in hip and knee joint replacement: socioeconomic inequalities and projections of need</article-title><source>Ann Rheum Dis</source><year>2004</year><volume>63</volume><issue>7</issue><fpage>825</fpage><lpage>8